  "content": "[Intro]\n[Am]\n[F7]\n[Dm]  [E7]\n[Am]\nI\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Am]work all night, I work all day, to\n[E]pay the bills I have to pay\nAin`t it sad\n[Am]And\nstill there never seems to be a\nsingle penny left for me\n[E]That`s too bad\n[Am]\nIn my dreams I\nhave a plan\n[F]If I got me a\nwealthy man I\n[Dm]wouldn`t have to work at all, I`d\n[B7]fool around and have a ball\n[E7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]Money, money, money\n[B7]Must be funny\n[E7]In the rich man`s world\n[Am]Money, money, money\n[B7]Always sunny\n[E7]In the rich man`s world\nAha\n[Dm]\n[E7]\n[A7]All the things I could do\n[Dm][F7]If [E7]I\n[Am]had a little money\n[Dm]It`s a [E7]rich man`s world\n[Am]\n[F7]\n[Dm]It`s a [E7]rich man`s world\n[Am]\nA\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Am]man like that is hard to find but\n[E7]I can`t get him off my mind\n[E]Ain`t it sad\n[Am]And\nif he happens to be free I\n[E7]bet he wouldn`t fancy me\n[E]That`s too bad\n[Am]So\nI must leave, I`ll\nhave to go\n[F]To Las Vegas or\nMona co And\n[Dm]win a fortune in a game, my\n[B7]life will never be the same\n[E7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]Money, money, money\n[B7]Must be funny\n[E7]In the rich man`s world\n[Am]Money, money, money\n[B7]Always sunny\n[E7]In the rich man`s world\nAha\n[Dm]\n[E7]\n[A7]All the things I could do\n[Dm][F7]If [E7]I\n[Am]had a little money\n[Dm]It`s a [E7]rich man`s world\n[Am]\n[F7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bbm]Money, money, money\n[C7]Must be funny\n[F7]In the rich man`s world\n[Bbm]Money, money, money\n[C7]Always sunny\n[F7]In the rich man`s world\nAha\n[Ebm]\n[F7]\n[Bb7]All the things I could do\n[Ebm][Gb7]If [F7]I\n[Bbm]had a little money\n[Ebm]It`s a [F7]rich man`s world\n[Bbm]\n[F#7]\n[Ebm]It`s a [F7]rich man`s world\n[Bbm]",
